            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>body { font-family: -apple-system, system-ui; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 6px 4px; } ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; } li { margin: 0 0 6px; }</style>
<ul>
<li>Settings are reorganized: your display sets come first, then General, Shortcuts, Automation and About.</li>
<li>Shortcuts shows every layout’s keyboard shortcut in one place.</li>
<li>Automation shows each display set’s automatic layout and a link for every layout.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
